h, who know they can count on him to sort things out properly."},{"k":"u13","type":"u","label":"Link: LinkedIn","default":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/harry-gleed-23a0ba1ba/"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Link text 2","default":"LinkedIn"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"Text 3","default":"CM"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"Heading 4","default":"Connor McGovern"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"1st Line Support Engineer"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"Connor is a 1st Line Support Engineer and often the first point of contact when clients need a hand. He focuses on desktop support and cloud system administration, and is a talented engineer who is picking up new skills quickly. Connor has become an integral part of the WhizzIT team."},{"k":"u19","type":"u","label":"Link: LinkedIn","default":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/connor-mcgovern-2911483b3/"},{"k":"s20","type":"s","label":"Link text 3","default":"LinkedIn"}]}